{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(t "Your SSO sign-in links") }}

{{!--
  The SSO sign-in links of the projects an account has joined, asked for
  on "Sign in with SSO" when it found no provider for the address's domain
  (#9987, Common/Types/Accounts/SsoSignInLinks, sent by
  App/FeatureSet/Identity/Utils/SsoSignInLinksEmail). Sent only to the
  address on the account, in the account's own language - and asked for by
  whoever typed the address, who may not have been its owner, so it says
  exactly what it is and that it can be ignored.

  A project's name and its providers' names are their admins' words, so
  they go on plainText, escaped, and into a sentence only through tt, which
  puts each value in as written into an escaped slot. Each link is
  OneUptime's own page for its project (/accounts/sso/<project id>), which
  lists the providers: the email links to no identity provider.
--}}

{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "Someone asked for the single sign-on (SSO) sign-in links of the projects your {{product}} account is in. Each button below opens that project's SSO sign-in page." product=productName)}}

{{#each projects}}
{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Project:") plainText=this.projectName }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Single sign-on:") plainText=this.providerNames }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=this.signInUrl buttonText=(tt "Sign In to {{project}}" project=this.projectName) }}
{{/each}}

{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "Bookmark a project's link to sign in through it next time. Signing in still goes through your organization's identity provider.")}}

{{!--
  When, from where and on which device it was asked for, in the reader's
  own time zone: anybody who knows an address can ask, so this is how its
  owner tells their own request from a stranger's.
--}}
{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Asked for at:") plainText=requestedAt }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "IP address:") plainText=requestIpAddress }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Approximate location:") plainText=requestLocation }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Device:") plainText=requestDevice }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If you did not ask for these links, you can ignore this email. Nothing on your account has changed.")}}

{{> Footer this}}

{{> End this}}
